+- Moving a member (`POST /projects/{pid}/members/{uid}/move`, for team moves)
+  removes the user from the project in the path and adds them to
+  `toProjectId` with the same role. Only managers of both projects may move
+  members (403 otherwise). The destination must be readable by the actor
+  (404 otherwise), in the same organization, and must not already have the
+  user (409). The move unassigns the user's tasks in the source project, since
